      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_43",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_44",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_45",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_46",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_47",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Hello! Are you all right? What’re you doing out here in the cold? ...she’s still not paying attention."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_48",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_49",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Err, hello? HELLO!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_50",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_51",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Aaah! Don’t sneak up on a woman like that; the jump you gave me nearly ruined three days’ work!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("I’m sorry, I just wanted to see if everything is all right. What’re you doing alone and unarmed all the way up here in these snows?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Ah, I’m glad you asked! You see, I’m an — err, how should I say it — alchemist, yes, yes, alchemist is right. A researcher!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("You’re a mage? That explains why you’re not carrying any weapons. Are you conducting some sort of magical experiment?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("No, no! I’m not one of those stuffy bleary-eyed academics; I don’t make magic, I cause chemistry! There’s all sorts of valuable alchemical reagents here in the mountains. I’m certain my theories are correct, I just need the ingredients to prove it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Most of the herbs, you see, I’ve had no trouble collecting. Err, but, well, the local fauna — as you may surmise, the fauna has proven somewhat less cooperative than for which I was prepared... Right! But now you’re here to help!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Here, take this leather pouch for the tongue... and yes, this glass jar for the bile— No! Not that one, this one—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("What is all this stuff? You... want me to gather some alchemy components for you, is that right? _ I am Konrad, heir to the throne of Wesnoth, and on a quest to depose the dark queen Asheviere. I’m happy to leave you with food or gold if you’re in trouble, but I’m not sure my army and I can spare the time to stop and help you collect ingredients."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Yes, ingredients, precisely! And if you did take the time to help me out, I’d be very grateful. And... and! If you help me, I’ll help you in return and come with you on your quest. A great chance to field-test my concoctions against that queen of yours."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("I only need three more ingredients to complete my experiments. Icemonax bile. Giant Spider venom — that one’s a doozy. And, err, believe it or not, Yeti tongue. If Yetis exist."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("... and if we can collect all three of these, you’ll come with us to help us fight against Asheviere? I suppose that sounds like a fair trade."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Absolutely! I may not be of much use right now, but once you get my ingredients for me I’ll be able to help you fight through the use of a variety of alchemical concoctions. For now, the keep is yours — I’ve noticed a very interesting species of beetle over here..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Jeniver",
            x: 15,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_52",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_53",
          },
        ],
      },
