          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Hmm? Oh, ah, did I forget to mention the chill? Silly me — there’s, err, yes there’s virtually always a storm blowing here; you’ll all be slowed down quite often, trying to keep warm while trudging through the deepening snowbanks. The local fauna are, of course, quite impervious to the cold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("True, true, but, well, you know, I suppose there’d really be no harm in coming with you even if you don’t get them all— yes, I think I’ll join you no matter what. You seem the nice sort, very chivalrous and all that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("But— err, of course I suppose I wouldn’t really be of much use to you unless you can gather at least some ingredients so that I can get my — you know — alchemical concoctions prepared. The more the better!"),
          },
        ],
