                equals: "yes",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("And with that— yes, with that, I have everything I needed from the north! Excellent! I wonder what substances I should turn my study to next..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-glad.webp",
            text: _("I’m glad to help! But don’t forget, you’d said you would join us if we helped you here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Hmm? Oh yes, yes, that’s quite right, of course. In fact I’ve got some new ideas that I’m just longing to pursue; perhaps joining you on your travels will provide me with a good opportunity for travel and research. I’d be glad to accompany you on your travels, Konrad!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_76",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("We musn’t take too long helping Jeniver. The air is frigid and growing worse by the minute; meanwhile Asheviere continues to grow stronger and stronger unchecked."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Jeniver has said she will still follow us even if we run out of time, but without all three ingredients she also won’t be as useful as she might otherwise have been."),
