          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Jeniver, I know we’d promised to help gather your alchemical ingredients, but between the cold and the threat of Asheviere we simply can’t spare any more time to help you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jeniver",
            text: _("Oh, yes, no I understand; that’s quite all right. In fact I’ve got some new ideas that I’m just longing to pursue; regardless of the remaining ingredients here, perhaps joining you on your travels will provide me with a good opportunity for travel and research. If you’ll have me, of course!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
